# Secrets and signing. A release key must never reach the repository.
*.jks
*.keystore
keystore.properties

# Camera data. All of it is reproducible from osm\ plus tools/import, and totals ~4 GB,
# so none of it belongs in the repository.
#
#   osm\        Geofabrik extracts (*.osm.pbf, ~4 GB) plus imported.txt, the manifest of
#               which upstream digest was last imported
#   data\       the built SQLite database and its backup
#
# imported.txt is the one exception: a 551-byte record of what was imported, worth keeping
# so a fresh clone can tell which extracts are missing.
*.osm.pbf
*.pbf.md5
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
data/
